<title>POLAND: Polish construction sales rise 13.2 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Polish construction sales rise 13.2 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales rose 13.2 percent in October and were 18.3 percent higher than in October 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p> POLISH CONSTRUCTION	  OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER	OCT 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	   13.2     6.8(6.6)	  11.3</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   18.3    16.3(16.1)	 22.9</p>
<p> index (monthly avge 1994=100)  70.9     na (50.7)	*68.1</p>
<p>					    JAN-OCTOBER 96  JAN-OCT 95</p>
<p> pct change vs same period 1994	   5.7	     15.5</p>
<p>NOTES - Revised data in brackets. October 1996 had 24 working days, September 1996 had 22 and October 1995 had 23 days.</p>
<p>* Unrevised index value based on monthly average from 1992.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
